"Sālikedāravagga ", "ja487:0.4": "4. Uddālakajātaka ", "ja487:1.1": "“Kharājinā jaṭilā paṅkadantā, ", "ja487:1.2": "Dummakkharūpā ye mantaṁ jappanti; ", "ja487:1.3": "Kaccinnu te mānusake payoge, ", "ja487:1.4": "Idaṁ vidū parimuttā apāyā”. ", "ja487:2.1": "“Pāpāni kammāni karetha rāja, ", "ja487:2.2": "Bahussuto ce na careyya dhammaṁ; ", "ja487:2.3": "Sahassavedopi na taṁ paṭicca, ", "ja487:2.4": "Dukkhā pamucce caraṇaṁ apatvā”. ", "ja487:3.1": "“Sahassavedopi na taṁ paṭicca, ", "ja487:3.2": "Dukkhā pamucce caraṇaṁ apatvā; ", "ja487:3.3": "Maññāmi vedā aphalā bhavanti, ", "ja487:3.4": "Sasaṁyamaṁ caraṇaññeva saccaṁ”. ", "ja487:4.1": "“Na heva vedā aphalā bhavanti, ", "ja487:4.2": "Sasaṁyamaṁ caraṇaññeva saccaṁ; ", "ja487:4.3": "Kittiñhi pappoti adhicca vede, ", "ja487:4.4": "Santiṁ puṇāti caraṇena danto”. ", "ja487:5.1": "“Bhaccā mātā pitā bandhū, ", "ja487:5.2": "yena jāto sayeva so; ", "ja487:5.3": "Uddālako ahaṁ bhoto, ", "ja487:5.4": "sottiyākulavaṁsako”. ", "ja487:6.1": "“Kathaṁ bho brāhmaṇo hoti, ", "ja487:6.2": "kathaṁ bhavati kevalī; ", "ja487:6.3": "Kathañca parinibbānaṁ, ", "ja487:6.4": "dhammaṭṭho kinti vuccati”. ", "ja487:7.1": "“Niraṅkatvā aggimādāya brāhmaṇo, ", "ja487:7.2": "Āpo siñcaṁ yajaṁ usseti yūpaṁ; ", "ja487:7.3": "Evaṅkaro brāhmaṇo hoti khemī, ", "ja487:7.4": "Dhamme ṭhitaṁ tena amāpayiṁsu”. ", "ja487:8.1": "“Na suddhi secanenatthi, ", "ja487:8.2": "nāpi kevalī brāhmaṇo; ", "ja487:8.3": "Na khantī nāpi soraccaṁ, ", "ja487:8.4": "nāpi so parinibbuto”. ", "ja487:9.1": "“Kathaṁ so brāhmaṇo hoti, ", "ja487:9.2": "kathaṁ bhavati kevalī; ", "ja487:9.3": "Kathañca parinibbānaṁ, ", "ja487:9.4": "dhammaṭṭho kinti vuccati”. ", "ja487:10.1": "“Akhettabandhū amamo nirāso, ", "ja487:10.2": "Nillobhapāpo bhavalobhakhīṇo; ", "ja487:10.3": "Evaṅkaro brāhmaṇo hoti khemī, ", "ja487:10.4": "Dhamme ṭhitaṁ tena amāpayiṁsu”. ", "ja487:11.1": "“Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, ", "ja487:11.2": "suddā caṇḍālapukkusā; ", "ja487:11.3": "Sabbeva soratā dantā, ", "ja487:11.4": "sabbeva parinibbutā; ", "ja487:11.5": "Sabbesaṁ sītibhūtānaṁ, ", "ja487:11.6": "atthi seyyotha pāpiyo”. ", "ja487:12.1": "“Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, ", "ja487:12.2": "suddā caṇḍālapukkusā; ", "ja487:12.3": "Sabbeva soratā dantā, ", "ja487:12.4": "sabbeva parinibbutā; ", "ja487:12.5": "Sabbesaṁ sītibhūtānaṁ, ", "ja487:12.6": "natthi seyyotha pāpiyo”. ", "ja487:13.1": "“Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, ", "ja487:13.2": "suddā caṇḍālapukkusā; ", "ja487:13.3": "Sabbeva soratā dantā, ", "ja487:13.4": "sabbeva parinibbutā. ", "ja487:14.1": "Sabbesaṁ sītibhūtānaṁ, ", "ja487:14.2": "Natthi seyyotha pāpiyo; ", "ja487:14.3": "Panatthaṁ carasi brahmaññaṁ, ", "ja487:14.4": "Sottiyākulavaṁsataṁ”. ", "ja487:15.1": "“Nānārattehi vatthehi, ", "ja487:15.2": "vimānaṁ bhavati chāditaṁ; ", "ja487:15.3": "Na tesaṁ chāyā vatthānaṁ, ", "ja487:15.4": "so rāgo anupajjatha. ", "ja487:16.1": "Evameva manussesu, ", "ja487:16.2": "yadā sujjhanti māṇavā; ", "ja487:16.3": "Te sajātiṁ pamuñcanti, ", "ja487:16.4": "dhammamaññāya subbatā”ti. ", "ja487:17.1": "Uddālakajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja487:0.1": "", "ja487:0.2": "", "ja487:0.3": "", "ja487:0.4": "", "ja487:1.1": "", "ja487:1.2": "Dummakkharūpā → dummudharūpā (bj, mr); dummukharūpā (pts-vp-pli1) | mantaṁ jappanti → yeme japanti (bj, pts-vp-pli1); ye mantaṁ japanti (sya1ed, sya2ed); ye'me jappanti mante (ja377:3 [Setaketujātaka]) ", "ja487:1.3": "", "ja487:1.4": "", "ja487:2.1": "karetha → karotha (bj, pts-vp-pli1); kareyya (sya1ed, sya2ed); katvāna (ja377:4 [Setaketujātaka]) ", "ja487:2.2": "", "ja487:2.3": "", "ja487:2.4": "pamucce → pamuñce (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja487:3.1": "", "ja487:3.2": "", "ja487:3.3": "", "ja487:3.4": "", "ja487:4.1": "", "ja487:4.2": "", "ja487:4.3": "Kittiñhi → kittiñca (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja487:4.4": "puṇāti → puṇoti (bj); puṇeti (sya1ed, sya2ed ja377:6 [Setaketujātaka]); puneti (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja487:5.1": "", "ja487:5.2": "so → bho (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja487:5.3": "bhoto → bhoti (mr) ", 